Unit 3 Analysis
In Unit 3, I learned about Kotlin classes, collections, scrollable lists, and animations. Data classes helped me organize related information, while collections made it easier to store and manage multiple items.
In the Affirmations app, I used `LazyColumn` to display a scrollable list of images and text. In the Woof app, I learned how state and animation can show or hide information smoothly.
Overall, this unit helped me understand how Kotlin data and Jetpack Compose work together to create organized and interactive Android applications.
